  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Another Beautiful Day, a bright, coastal-style home nestled in Dune Allen Beach on 30A — just a few steps from the sand and surf. Perfect for large families or groups, this 5-bedroom getaway blends comfort, space, and charm. Just 800 feet from the sugar-white sands, this home sleeps 14 and features a private pool with tanning ledge, huge fenced backyard, and a balcony with sparkling Gulf views and breeze. The front door opens into a beautiful open living area with plenty of space for everyone. Turn on the TV and watch your favorite movie while you whip up a meal in the fully stocked kitchen. Enjoy your meal or a board game on the large barnwood dining table. Afterwards, challenge your family to one of the many boardgames or a retro game on the arcade.<br><br>Step out onto the wraparound porch or unwind by your private pool, surrounded by lush palms and complete privacy fencing. If you are feeling adventurous, hop on the golf cart or a bike and explore down 30A. Or load up the beach wagon and walk across the street to the public beach access. Fire up the grill, dine alfresco, and relax — this backyard was made for fun!<br><br>Room to Relax<br>🛌 5 Bedrooms | 🛁 3 Bathrooms <br> <br>Downstairs: <br>Bedroom 1 - 2 Sets of Twin Bunk Beds<br>Bedroom 2 - 2 Sets of Twin-over-Full Bunk Beds<br>Full Bathroom w/ Walk-In Shower<br><br>Upstairs:<br>Bedroom 3 - Spacious Master Suite with King Bed, Ensuite Bath and Walk-in Shower, Private Balcony w/ Ocean Views<br>Bedroom 4 - King Bed w/ Ocean View<br>Bedroom 5 - Queen Bed w/ Pool View<br>Full Bathroom w/ Walk-In Shower<br><br>🛺 Golf Cart, Bikes, & Games<br>6 Seater LSV included free with stay. Four bikes are available as well (Please bring your helmet). The house is also stocked with fun games and puzzles for the whole family.<br><br>🏖️ Steps from the Sand<br>Load up the provided beach wagon and beach chairs and take a short walk over to the public beach access just in front of the house. The access has a ramp right down to the sand and clean public restrooms.<br><br>🕶️ Yards of Fun<br>Your private fenced backyard with in-ground pool featuring a tanning ledge awaits. Take a splash or catch some rays in one of the 6 lounge chairs. Fire up the grill and enjoy some yard games on the patio.<br><br>🧺 Ease & Enjoyment<br>Enjoy the ease of home with a washer and dryer, iron, and ironing board. Enjoy family-friendly touches like a Pack & Play, high chair, and a starter kit of toilet paper, paper towels, laundry detergent, dish detergent, shampoo, conditioner, and soap.<br><br>🚗 Parking & Location<br>Park up to 3 cars in the driveway. Four bikes are in the garage waiting and ready for you. Enjoy the beach wagon and chairs provided and the close proximity to the beach access with parking and restrooms. Walk over to a local favorite restaurant for dinner and live music or take a quick little ride on the bikes to explore more dining and fun spots.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Gulf View-Near Beach-Golf Cart-Bikes-Private Pool"
        }
      ],
